flowchart TB
  subgraph Run["AgentRun state machine"]
    Queued((queued))
    Running((running))
    Awaiting((awaiting approval))
    Approved((approved))
    Completed((completed))
    Failed((failed))
    Cancelled((cancelled))

    Queued -->|worker claims one attempt lease| Running
    Running -->|expired lease reclaimed| Running
    Running -->|grounded plan stored| Awaiting
    Running -->|timeout, invalid schema, provider or budget failure| Failed
    Queued -->|user cancel with expected version| Cancelled
    Running -->|user cancel wins row lock| Cancelled
    Awaiting -->|user cancel| Cancelled
    Failed -->|retry before Course exists, append attempt| Queued
    Cancelled -->|retry, append attempt| Queued
    Awaiting -->|user approves cited steps in one transaction| Approved
    Approved -->|all materialization work items complete| Completed
    Approved -->|any materialization work item fails| Failed
    Failed -->|retry failed materialization only| Approved
  end

  subgraph Budget["Atomic lifetime budget reservation"]
    Lease["Lock the leased run and attempt"]
    Reserve{"Cumulative wall time, tool calls,<br/>tokens and estimated cost stay in fixed limits?"}
    Charge["Atomically reserve usage on run and attempt"]
    Tool["Start the paid retrieval tool call<br/>bounded by the lifetime wall-time deadline"]
    Deny["Do not start the tool call<br/>record budget exhausted"]

    Lease --> Reserve
    Reserve -->|yes| Charge --> Tool
    Reserve -->|no| Deny
  end

  subgraph Materialize["Approval and asynchronous materialization"]
    Course["Create and publish Course with cited snapshots"]
    Work["Create video, retrieval and quiz work items<br/>append matching outbox events"]
    Settle["Workers settle each item"]
    Course --> Work --> Settle
  end

  subgraph Learning["Progress and quiz state machine"]
    Interval["Raw watched interval with idempotency key"]
    Merge["Advisory lock per user and step<br/>merge clipped ranges without double counting"]
    Quiz["Published quiz<br/>exactly five cited questions"]
    Submit["Serialize attempts, keep answers private,<br/>update best score"]
    Gate{"Server sees watched coverage at least 80 percent<br/>and best quiz score at least 70 percent?"}
    Partial((in progress))
    Learned((completed))

    Interval --> Merge --> Gate
    Quiz --> Submit --> Gate
    Gate -->|no| Partial
    Partial -->|later progress or quiz event| Gate
    Gate -->|yes| Learned
  end

  Running -. "before each paid call" .-> Lease
  Tool -. "measured usage and outcome settle" .-> Running
  Deny --> Failed
  Approved --> Course
  Settle --> Completed
  Course --> Interval
  Work --> Quiz
